#. ja: 惑星アウクセシア探索計画の手形
#. de: Auxesia-Marke
#. fr: avoir de l'exploration cosmique (Auxesia)
#. column 2: Auxesia exploration tokens
#. column 8: A slip awarded in exchange for successful completion of high-difficulty missions on Auxesia, and exchangeable for rare incentive items prepared by the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. These things don't grow on trees, you know.
#. column 9: Auxesia Exploration Token
msgctxt "Item:52092:0:0"
msgid "Auxesia exploration token"
msgstr "жетон исследования Ауксезии"

#. de: Auxesia-Marken
#. fr: avoirs de l'exploration cosmique (Auxesia)
#. column 0: Auxesia exploration token
#. column 8: A slip awarded in exchange for successful completion of high-difficulty missions on Auxesia, and exchangeable for rare incentive items prepared by the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. These things don't grow on trees, you know.
#. column 9: Auxesia Exploration Token
msgctxt "Item:52092:0:2"
msgid "Auxesia exploration tokens"
msgstr "жетоны исследования Ауксезии"

#. ja: コスモエクスプローラー計画機構が発行した手形。惑星アウクセシアにて高難易度のミッションを完了した計画貢献者へ贈られ、特別な品と交換できる
#. de: Eine vom Projektkomitee der Kosmo-Erkundung ausgestellte Marke. Wird als Belohnung für den Abschluss besonders schwieriger Stellarmissionen verteilt und kann gegen verschiedene Güter eingetauscht werden.
#. fr: Un avoir émis par le comité d'or<shy>ga<shy>ni<shy>sa<shy>tion du projet d'exploration cosmique. Offert aux contributeurs en récompense de missions ardues, il peut être échangé contre des lots spéciaux.
#. column 0: Auxesia exploration token
#. column 2: Auxesia exploration tokens
#. column 9: Auxesia Exploration Token
msgctxt "Item:52092:0:8"
msgid "A slip awarded in exchange for successful completion of high-difficulty missions on Auxesia, and exchangeable for rare incentive items prepared by the Cosmic Exploration Initiative. These things don't grow on trees, you know."
msgstr "Жетон выдают за успешное выполнение сложных заданий на Ауксезии. Его можно обменять на редкие награды от Инициативы космических исследований. Такие жетоны с неба не падают, знаешь ли."

