#. ja: 道化師のトーテム像
#. de: Gaukler-Totem
#. fr: totem du bouffon dément
#. column 2: mad harlequin's totems
#. column 8: A small-yet-handsomely crafted idol of Kefka, fashioned by himself on a whim. A message addressed to you is hand-carved into the base:<br><br>“Well? What're you waiting for? Buy yourself a nice weapon, why don't you!”
#. column 9: Mad Harlequin's Totem
msgctxt "Item:52321:0:0"
msgid "mad harlequin's totem"
msgstr "тотем безумного арлекина"

#. de: Gaukler-Totems
#. fr: totems du bouffon dément
#. column 0: mad harlequin's totem
#. column 8: A small-yet-handsomely crafted idol of Kefka, fashioned by himself on a whim. A message addressed to you is hand-carved into the base:<br><br>“Well? What're you waiting for? Buy yourself a nice weapon, why don't you!”
#. column 9: Mad Harlequin's Totem
msgctxt "Item:52321:0:2"
msgid "mad harlequin's totems"
msgstr "тотемы безумного арлекина"

#. ja: 道化師ケフカを象った小像。彼自身が戯れに作ったらしい
#. de: Ein kleines Totem, das den wahnsinnigen Gaukler Kefka darstellt und allem Anschein nach von diesem höchst<shy>persön<shy>lich erschaffen wurde.
#. fr: Un totem à l'effigie de Kefka. Il aurait été façonné par le clown de la destruction en personne.
#. column 0: mad harlequin's totem
#. column 2: mad harlequin's totems
#. column 9: Mad Harlequin's Totem
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:52321:0:8"
msgid "A small-yet-handsomely crafted idol of Kefka, fashioned by himself on a whim. A message addressed to you is hand-carved into the base:<br><br>“Well? What're you waiting for? Buy yourself a nice weapon, why don't you!”"
msgstr "Небольшая, но искусно выполненная статуэтка Кефки, которую он, похоже, смастерил от нечего делать. На постаменте вырезано послание тебе:<br><br>«Ну? Чего ждёшь? Купи себе хорошее оружие, что ли!»"

